WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Welcome to the Aura guided build.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:09.150
You decide whether to increase acquisition
spending next quarter or first improve

3
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.250
activation and transaction reliability.

4
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.768
Aura is a fictional Malaysian consumer
payments company distributed through web

5
00:00:15.768 --> 00:00:17.000
and mobile apps.

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.400
Every supplied figure is synthetic.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.857
Your goal is a dashboard you can inspect
and a recommendation you

8
00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.600
can defend.

9
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.867
Before starting, sign in to ChatGPT
desktop, check Plus usage, and confirm

10
00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:32.500
Work, Sites and Pages are available.

11
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.550
Download and extract the six Aura files.

12
00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:40.255
Attach the folder to a local project when
supported, or attach all

13
00:00:40.255 --> 00:00:43.000
six files to the same Work chat.

14
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.700
You need no spreadsheet editor or separate
business intelligence application.

15
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:53.154
Your executive information system connects
headline metrics to definitions and source

16
00:00:53.154 --> 00:00:53.650
inputs.

17
00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.600
Filters let you investigate.

18
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.600
A spending control exposes an assumption.

19
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:02.800
A separate Pages brief records your
decision; changing a filter must not

20
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.850
rewrite that record.

21
00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:08.150
The reporting period ends in June twenty
twenty-six.

22
00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.950
The snapshot was finalized on the
thirty-first of July.

23
00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:15.450
Pause and open the folder or attach its
files.

24
00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:19.650
Confirm that ChatGPT can list the six
actual filenames.

25
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:24.950
Write the Board question, the next-quarter
horizon and the CEO decision owner.

26
00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:28.150
A filename does not prove the contents
were read.

27
00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:33.150
Next, you check extraction and meaning
before asking for charts.
